  "question": {
    "text": "Consider the greatest integer function, defined by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>[</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>]</mo><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>2</mn></math>. Then",
